<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19988" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gryllus</span></b> , i, m., =<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γρύλλος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a Greek proper name.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A son of Xenophon</i>, <i>who fell in
				the battle at Mantinea</i>, <i>and was celebrated
				by Aristotle in a monogram entitled</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γρύλλος</span>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 2,
				17, 14</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A Roman proper name</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 1,
				60, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 14,
				13</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
